    "text": "The coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></math> in the expansion of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
