  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math>  <br >Possible combination of 9 are (0, 9), (1, 8), (2, 7), (3, 6), (4, 5), (1, 2, 6), (1, 3, 5), (2, 3, 4)<br >So, coefficient = 8.",
